[["heading","P RACTICAL PROJECT / PART 2\nDebug an unreachable API"],["text","Use this layer-by-layer checklist in an authorized development environment."],["heading","Symptom\nCheck\nInterpretation"],["text","Name not\nresolved\nnslookup / dig\nCheck DNS records, resolver and spelling."],["text","Connection\nrefused\nss -ltn; server logs\nNo accepting listener or active rejection; inspect bind\naddress."],["text","Connection\ntimeout\nRoute, firewall, service\nstatus\nPossible packet drops or unresponsive path; not a\nunique diagnosis."],["text","TLS validation\nerror\nCertificate hostname,\nchain, time\nRepair trust or certificate configuration; do not\nbypass validation."],["text","HTTP 401 / 403\nCredentials and access\npolicy\nCheck authentication / authorization."],["text","HTTP 500\nApplication logs and\nrequest ID\nInvestigate the backend root cause."],["heading","Interview rehearsal"],["text","Explain the path from browser URL to DNS, transport connection, TLS and HTTP response. Describe\nwhat evidence distinguishes a DNS error, transport failure and HTTP 500."],["sinhala","","Error එJක් layer එක මුලින් හඳුනාගන්න. Evidence නැතුව firewall Jහහෝ database එකට Jදෙහෝෂය පවරන්න",500],["sinhala","","එපා.",24],["heading","Further reading"],["text","Syllabus: Full_Stack_SE_Internship_Checklist.pdf, section 27, p. 9. Previous additions:\nSections_04-34_Full_Stack_Interview_Study_Guide.pdf, pp. 76–78. New topics selected for internship preparation."],["text","Reference resources: man7.org/linux/man-pages/ · docs.python.org/3/library/http.server.html · developer.mozilla.org/\nen-US/docs/Web/HTTP · rfc-editor.org (TCP RFC 9293; TLS 1.3 RFC 8446; QUIC RFC 9000; HTTP/3 RFC 9114)."]]